[[2,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Open the bonnet lid.</p><p><a href=\"#/2891384\">1044B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891385\">1044B20</a></p><p>1. Undo the fitting  (1a) and remove fuel heater (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2034134.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the fuel heater.</p><p>Tighten the central fitting.</p><p><a href=\"#/2891385\">1044B20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891384\">1044B10</a></p><p>Close the bonnet lid.</p>"]]